    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Sheehy Meares Real Estate are delighted to present No. 43 Garran Ard, Doughiska, Galway to the market for sale by Private Treaty. This superb own-door duplex apartment extends to approximately 83 sq.m (893 sq.ft.) and is presented in excellent turnkey condition, offering bright, spacious accommodation.\n\nNo. 43 is a bright and spacious own-door duplex apartment offering well-designed accommodation over two levels. Internally, the property comprises an entrance hallway, spacious living room, well-appointed kitchen/dining area, wc and two generous bedrooms. The impressive master bedroom occupies the upper floor, creating a private retreat complete with its own bathroom and additional storage room\n\nA standout feature of the home is its generous private balcony, which enjoys sunshine throughout the day. Complete with a retractable awning and ample space for outdoor dining and entertaining, it provides the perfect setting for relaxing or enjoying al fresco dining during the warmer months.\n\nGarran Ard is a highly sought-after residential development on the east side of Galway City, ideally situated within walking distance of an excellent range of local amenities. Shopping centres and retail parks, including Dunnes Stores, Lidl, Tesco Express and Briarhill Shopping Centre, are all nearby, while a selection of primary and secondary schools, playgrounds and the beautiful Merlin Woods are within easy reach.\n\nThe property is ideally positioned close to Parkmore, Ballybrit and Ballybane Business Parks, home to many of Galway's leading employers including Boston Scientific, Medtronic and numerous medical device and technology companies. Excellent public transport links provide regular access to Galway City Centre and surrounding areas, while the nearby M6 and M18 motorways offer convenient connectivity to the wider region.\n\nPresented in excellent decorative order throughout, No. 43 offers a superb opportunity for first-time buyers, professionals, investors or those looking to downsize, combining low-maintenance living with an exceptional location close to every amenity Galway City has to offer."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "Spacious own-door duplex apartment extending to approximately 83 sq.m (893 sq.ft.)\nPresented in excellent turnkey condition\nBright accommodation laid out over two levels\nLarge master bedroom on the upper floor with private en-suite bathroom\nPrivate balcony enjoying all-day sunshine with retractable awning and dining area\nExcellent location close to shops, schools, business parks and transport links\nEasy access to Galway City Centre, M6 and M18 motorways\nIdeal for first-time buyers, professionals, downsizers and investors\nOil fired central heating\n\n"
      },
